          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వార్షికోత్సవం — vārṣikōtsavaṁ — \"an anniversary\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మా బడి వార్షికోత్సవం ఘనంగా జరిగింది. mā baḍi vārṣikōtsavaṁ ghanaṅgā jarigindi. Our school's anniversary was celebrated in style."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వార్షిక, yearly: a yearly celebration."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వార్షికోత్సవం (vārṣikōtsavaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit: vārṣika, \"annual\" (CDIAL 11571), and utsava, \"a festival\" (CDIAL 1876)."
            }
          ]
        },
